  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.35 - AM030 converter diagnostics split\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM030 now owns only invalid converter implementation diagnostics\n            - AM032 reports nullable-source converter null-handling issues and keeps the null-guard code fix\n            - AM033 reports unused type converter declarations as analyzer-only guidance\n            - Rule catalog, docs, samples, and analyzer health notes now expose independent converter rule IDs\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (824 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - GitHub PR checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.34 - AM021/AM022 analyzer health calibration",
